.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-DATABOOK 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-databook \- Export a graph as a DataBook, or import a DataBook\*(Aqs graph data
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu databook\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export a graph as a DataBook, or import a DataBook\*(Aqs graph data
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-databook\-export(1)
Write one graph, current or as of a past point, as a DataBook
.TP
quipu\-databook\-import(1)
Load a DataBook\*(Aqs graph blocks in one write; never runs its queries
.TP
quipu\-databook\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
